  "description": "Create, delete, and train speaker recognition profiles in Windows applications using Microsoft SAPI, Microsoft Speech Platform, and Nuance Dragon NaturallySpeaking speech recognition engines.\n\nIntegrate speaker profile training, microphone setup, and other functions as part of its speech recognition administrative features.\n\nUse ProfileKit in the Chant Developer Workbench to interactively create and delete speaker profiles, invoke recognizer built-in speaker training and other profile administration services.\n\nDocumentation is available at https://www.chant.net/support/documentation/profilekit.\n\nSamples are available at https://www.chant.net/support/downloads.\n\nNOTE: This is a commercial software product and requires a purchased license for use. Evaluation credentials are available at https://www.chant.net/support/downloads. Purchased licensed credentials are available at https://www.chant.net/store. See https://www.chant.net/products/profilekit for more information about evaluating and purchasing licenses.",
